  "schemaVersion": "0.2.0",
  "kind": "graph",
  "generatedAt": "2026-10-02T18:34:44.320Z",
  "title": "osf review: multi-agent PR review pipeline",
  "summary": "Adds a full pull-request review subsystem to osf: a shipped catalogue of 20 review lenses, a roster of coding agents (dsh, omp, opencode, codex, claude) selected from osf.toml, per-reviewer headless runs in a clean copy of the change with only that reviewer's credential, quote verification of every finding against the real files, a deterministic reducer that turns answers into a verdict, and a new GitHub Actions workflow that builds osf from the base branch, runs each reviewer in its own job, and posts the decision. It also reworks suppression ownership in osf-lint-core and adds --no-suppress to scan.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
